From: Maksym Paziuk <17340729+virus-on@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 00:14:14 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] aic8800: add driver package for the AIC8800 SDIO Wi-Fi

Packaging from ImmortalWrt (via akorshun/aic8800-openwrt), building the
radxa-pkg/aic8800 driver at a pinned commit.

Adds 100-cfg80211-wdev-api.patch so the driver builds against the
cfg80211 API in Linux 6.18, where several ops take a wireless_dev and
the TDLS structures changed.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
